This repository publishes an integration protocol for health data. The code
and documents describe what the Syncky iPhone app and the Syncky relay do; they
are not a guarantee of any security, privacy or medical property. Health data
decrypted by an agent or received by a server built from this repository is in
the control of whoever runs that agent or server. See https://syncky.app/privacy
and https://syncky.app/terms for the app and the relay.

